{
  "_comment": "Units titan must come back with after a brownout or reboot. boot_resilience.sh check/apply reads this. Platform units are OS packages; titan units live under server-setup/ or were installed by runtime deploy. optional stays listed so check reports them without enabling.",
  "bios": [
    "UEFI/BIOS: set AC Power Loss / Restore After AC Power Loss / After Power Loss to Power On (not Stay Off / Last State). Without this the chassis stays dark after a brownout until someone presses the power button — no software can fix that.",
    "Leave Wake-on-LAN optional; do not rely on it for brownouts.",
    "If the board has a hardware watchdog, enable it."
  ],
